  "card": "Modifies legacy wallet migration to SQLite by skipping legacy records, transactions, and address book entries during the initial database record copy rather than writing them and erasing them later. Because migration reconstructs descriptor records, transactions, and address book entries directly, writing and deleting them was redundant. This cleanup eliminates unnecessary database writes during migration and allows the removal of unused wallet record deletion methods, including RemoveTxs and EraseTx. It has no dependencies.",
